🎗️ 29.8 Why Do We Need zeroFlag?

Without zeroFlag, both threads would not have an explicit way to know whose turn it is.

👉 For example:
currNumber = 2

We know the number is 2, but we also need to know:
Should Zero print?
or:
Should Even-Odd print 2?

The zeroFlag removes this ambiguity.

true
 ↓
Zero Thread

false
 ↓
Even-Odd Thread

